### Executive Infrastructure Dashboard {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`Power BI` `SQL` `Postgres` `Dataverse` `DAX` `Data Modeling`
:::

Designed and built a comprehensive, real-time executive dashboard consolidating
financial and operational performance across all business units. Revenue, gross
profit, margin, utilization, capacity, and throughput — unified in one
interactive platform with drill-through from portfolio level to individual
facilities.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** Real-time executive visibility · Self-service drill-through · Adopted for weekly decisions
:::

[View Details →](projects/power-bi-migration.qmd){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 2: DATA RECONCILIATION ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### Multi-Region Data Reconciliation Framework {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`SQL` `Postgres` `Dataverse` `Power BI` `Data Governance`
:::

Reconciled site inventory data across 40+ Postgres tables spanning four
major regions (NE, Rockies, Permian, MidCon). Built a reusable
troubleshooting framework that standardized how the organization
identifies and resolves data discrepancies.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** 100% query accuracy · 4-region coverage · Reusable framework
:::

[View Details →](projects/data-reconciliation.qmd){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 3: MEDICARE FRAUD ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### Medicare Fraud Case Analytics {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`SQL` `Power BI` `TennCare` `Healthcare Data` `Legal Analytics`
:::

Built analytical datasets supporting Medicare Fraud prosecution at the
Tennessee Attorney General's Office. Gained direct TennCare database
access, redesigned data workflows, and transitioned the team from Excel
to Power BI — cutting case preparation from 3 weeks to 2–3 days.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** 3 weeks → 2 days turnaround · Directly supported prosecutions
:::

[View Details →](projects/medicare-fraud.qmd){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 4: BI FORGE ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### BI Forge — Enterprise AI Analytics Platform {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`React` `FastAPI` `Claude API` `PostgreSQL` `Azure AD` `AWS`
:::

Designed and built an enterprise-wide BI platform giving every employee
access to role-filtered dashboards or plain-English data queries backed
by live SQL. Role-based access via Azure AD, an AI Prompt Studio for
natural language → SQL → visual, and a pipeline health panel powered by Dagster.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** Democratized data access across 8 dashboard domains · Eliminated ad-hoc request backlog
:::

[View Details →](projects/bi-forge.qmd){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 5: STREAMLINE ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### Streamline — BI Visual Development Pipeline {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`React` `Express.js` `Claude API` `PostgreSQL` `dbt` `Docker` `Power BI`
:::

Built a 7-stage AI-assisted pipeline that takes a dashboard visual from
stakeholder requirements to a production Power BI artifact — with live
data validation, automated quality checks, and a formal sign-off gate
built into every stage.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** Eliminated ad-hoc visual dev · Structured sign-off gate · Auto-generates DAX + TOM scripts
:::

[View Details →](projects/streamline.qmd){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 6: DATA DETECTIVE ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### Data Detective — AI Data Quality Diagnostic Tool {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`React` `Claude API` `PostgreSQL` `dbt` `SSE Streaming` `Docker`
:::

Built a chat interface that autonomously traces dbt lineage, runs live
SQL, and diagnoses data quality issues in minutes — naming the root cause
and fix owner so analysts don't have to manually navigate the DAG. Covers
both active dbt repositories.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** Hours → minutes diagnosis · Self-serve for junior analysts · Full team deployment ready
:::

[View Details →](projects/data-detective.qmd){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 7: AFE PORTFOLIO DASHBOARD ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### AFE Portfolio Executive Dashboard {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`Power BI` `DAX` `HTML/CSS` `JavaScript` `Capital Project Analytics`
:::

Built a fully self-contained Power BI HTML Content visual giving executive
leadership real-time visibility into AFE capital project budgets, committed
spend, CIP balances, and schedule slippage — with 8 KPI cards, 5 collapsible
detail tables, and responsive layouts across all viewport sizes.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** Executive portfolio visibility · Schedule slippage quantified · 3,000+ lines of DAX
:::

[View Details →](projects/afe-portfolio-dashboard.qmd){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 8: SCADA VOLUMES ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### SCADA Disposal Facility Volumes Dashboard {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`HTML/CSS` `Chart.js` `Python` `dbt` `PostgreSQL` `SCADA`
:::

Designed and built a self-contained HTML dashboard for monitoring disposal
facility volumes, utilization, and skim oil recovery across all regions.
Includes reactive filters, color-coded utilization thresholds, and a
6-month forward forecast — refreshed daily via a Python script.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** Real-time facility visibility · 6-month forecast · 18-column dbt model documented
:::

[View Details →](projects/scada-volumes.qmd){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 9: TRE CHEM COST ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### Labour & Chemical Cost Dashboards — TRE Chem {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`Power BI` `DAX` `HTML/CSS` `JavaScript` `Cost Analytics`
:::

Built two linked Power BI HTML visuals for monitoring labour and chemical
treatment costs at TRE Chem facilities. Features 16 KPI cards, automated
anomaly alerting, employee-level drill-down, cost-per-barrel efficiency
tracking, and a light/dark theme toggle.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** Cost/bbl surfaced · Proactive anomaly alerts · Employee-level visibility
:::

[View Details →](projects/tre-chem-cost.qmd){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 10: HP DASHBOARDS ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### Global Dashboard Initiative — HP Inc {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`Power BI` `Data Pipelines` `Stakeholder Management` `Global Teams`
:::

Developed high-level dashboards with drill-through capabilities for global
teams at HP. Promoted to lead senior management's highest-priority
dashboard initiative based on performance. Collaborated with data
engineering to deploy new pipelines.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** Promoted to lead highest-priority initiative · Global adoption
:::

[View Details →](#){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 11: COVENANT HEALTH ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### Opioid Audit & Revenue Recovery — Covenant Health {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`SQL` `EHR` `Healthcare` `Compliance` `Automation`
:::

Identified $4K/month in uncharged medication revenue through a
government-required opioid audit. Automated backend nursing documentation
forms and implemented new radiology procedures to improve operational
efficiency across clinical departments.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** $4K/month revenue recovered · Automated clinical workflows
:::

[View Details →](#){.project-link}

:::


<!-- ===== PROJECT 12: KNIGHT TRANSPORTATION ===== -->
::: {.project-card}

### Fleet Optimization — Knight Transportation {.project-name}

::: {.project-tags}
`Operations` `Fleet Management` `KPI Tracking` `Process Improvement`
:::

Managed 60+ drivers across scheduling, contracts, and compliance.
Applied data-driven fuel and speed management strategies that boosted
gross revenue by 12% and slashed fleet idle time from 55% to 20%.
This operational foundation informs every analytical decision I make today.

::: {.project-impact}
**Impact:** 12% revenue increase · 55% → 20% idle time · 'Best Dispatcher' award
:::

[View Details →](#){.project-link}

:::

:::


